# beating the mage's and the fighter's tower rooms (0xA2BF OR 4, 0xA3F2 OR 8), never fighting at the gate. Earlier
# walks either fought at the gate first (0xA60E sets 4, 8 and 16 together) or never beat both towers before
# stepping on event 8. Set by shortcut: 0x4A77 = 108 (96 | 4 | 8).
